/*
   author:  Rony G. Flatscher
   date:    2010-02-20, 2010-03-13
   purpose: demonstrate taking screenshots from java.awt.Components (a javax.swing.JFrame,
            and also just a javax.swing.JButton embedded in the frame) exploiting
            "bsfScreenShot.cls"

   license:

    ------------------------ Apache Version 2.0 license -------------------------
